        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorduuká' an kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa máy, as múk Israeli kudá' slaqwarár yaamaá Kana'ani ga xuaaká nguwa iiari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí gana tleéhh as kahhó' umuúqo qartá hi'iita ar múk Israeli slaqwara ngiwa intsahh, ak aleeró kudá' slaqwara ngi geerií xua'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorduudá' taa máy an kuká': Ayeemaá kooán awa waawituú Filisti nee múk Kana'ani sleémeero, nee múk Sidoni, nee múk Hifi, kudá' baraá tlom'aá Lebanonír hootá', iimír tloomár Ba'al-hermonír wa tleemu ay Lebo-hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gina máy as múk Israeli nguwa iiari ar xoorduudá', as ngiwa tsaahhi, áx hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngi iialoeesiía, tidá' aa baabi'ii'ín i oó' ar loohír Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo xoorór Israeli ina hót baraá tla/ángw múk Kana'anír wá ale nee oo Hiti, nee oo Amori nee oo Perisi, nee oo Hifi nee oo Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dasuú mukdá' ngway duxuutiyé', nee dasuuín oo kilá' kuna duxuút nee daaqoó xoorduudá', munguaá xoorduudá' ngiri sagadiyuusiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli adór slasla/aar gana tleéhh dír ilaá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín nguri gunqareesiyé', inooín munguiidá' ta bay Ba'ali nee Ashera ngiri sagadiyuusiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri buúhh, múk Israeli guri máy kuwa baali, nee waawutmoó Mesopotamia oo ta bay Kushan-rishataimu. Múk Israeli Kushan-rishataimu nguri sagadiyuusiyé' ar har afiqoomár kureeraá dakaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomár xoorór Israeli iwa /á/ amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ heé xoorór Israeli ga tuú/ guri sláy, heewí ku bay Otnieli garmoó Kenasi, hhiyoó niiná oo Kalebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qeeruú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Otnieli guri hatsiís, inós tari har'ohusmoó múk Israeli, iri slaqwarár áy. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Kushan-rishataimu waawutmoó Mesapotamia guri gawaá dabaawós i qaás, inós Kushan-rishataimu guri baál. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamu wayda nguri slayé' ar har afiqoomár kureeraá mibeeri tsiyahhe. Aluuwo Otnieli garmoó Kenasi iri gwaá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo xoorór Israeli tlakweema giri malé tléhh dír ilaá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ waawutmo Egloni oo Moabu guri /uurií haniís xoorór Israeli ngiwa baali, asma tlakweemaadá' naa tleehhiyé' dír ilaá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egloni xoorór Amoni nee Amaleki gana burumbuúr, tari slaáqw nee xoorór Israeli, xoorór Israeli kari baál. Inooín gixsadár slaansla ngari hayoohiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli waawutmo Egloni, oo Moabu guri sagadiyús ar har afiqoomár kureeri mibaá nee dakaát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomár xoorór Israeli AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa i /á/, gina iiárií qaás, heé gi tuú/ guri sláy. Heewí an Ehudi, garmoó Gera, heé dawa bás, oo tlahhoó Benyamini. Looarka wake xoorór Israeli Ehudi guri ya/áp as ohme ngiwa huwi amór waawutmo Egloni oo Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi paángár afe tsár gana tleéhh, tlenaango a sentimiíta mibeeri kooán, gari tseék baraá afetloowós, bihhaá doó /iyáy, baraá guruú tlabaawós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Egloni oo Moabu guri ohmeérí huúw. Egloni a heé aa ló'wa wahhaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi ohme haniisaro ngiwa hhe'eés, mukdá' ohme ngaa huuw, guri báy, «Tlawsé' watlé'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inós iwa hardáh dír tlaa/eedá' taa qaalín awa iisaapoó Gilgali, iri kií/ amór waawutmo Egloni guri báy, «Aá waawutámo /aymuuwók kooko oo naaqo u koóm.» Waawutmo sagadiyuseerós gari báy, «Quutlé'.» Inooín niri tsee/ií ti'iitiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi iri tseewúy amór waawutmo gawaá siitsana, didá' tsa' waawutmo iwa fur'ár /ayi, guri báy, «Ya/abtoorók tooka a koóm ar amór Mungú daahh.» Waawutmo nina gawaá kitaangós wa tláy iri sihhiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi ar dakós oo doó basayhe paángarós ngina duúx bihhaá doó /iyáy wa alé, Egloni guri gura' muút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paangadá' ina qupu/út, tam kipaywós sleeme iri dáh baraá gurií alé, di/i paángadá' gari ót. Asma Ehudi paánga gaa duuxiiká, saanka nari tsee/ií wá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Ehudi iri afeenírí ti'iít, afér do' gari alií tseék. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi iwa tláy, sagadiyuusér waawutmo iri kí/. Ngiwa ariyé' adór afér do' kara tseék, tari oó', «Doóqa aako aa sla/atá slahhtá áy.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari damraarán naxés aako afkú do' gu gwediitiiká, niri xuruutiyé', naagáy gweermo ngiri taataahhiyé' afkú do' kuri gweér, naxés aakooín aa huú' baraá tleera, slám aa gwaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár mukdá' iwa daamaaran, Ehudi iri /akuút dir'ín wa ale, iri waaraáhh ar gawaá tlaa/eedá' taa qaalín, iri tiaaín ay Seira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwa hardáh baraá yaamaá tlom'aá Efraimuwo, tarumbeéta gari ufaáhh. Ehudi xoorór Israeli gari geerahaár, niri al'aweeriyé' gawaá tloomár wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giri báy, «Aníng na eeharaaré' asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wakuuserhúng tidár Moabu ngaa gawaá dabaahúng i qaás.» Ehudi nguri eehariyé', tari /eét ay amór yaaér Yordani, didá' ta warhhaahhati ar ya'a', ngiri hayoohiyé', ngiri tseegiyé', tam heé wák aa waarahhiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
