              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy múk Moabu kuri baál nee xoorór Israeli, har kureeraá mibeeri dakaate, yaamu niri amohhoouyé'.",
          "type": "text",
